    "m_Title": "HTrace AO Buffer",
    "m_Content": "Works only when the Injection Point is set to \"Before Opaque\" in the HTrace AO UI, otherwise, it returns a white color.\n\nContains a 0–1 monochromatic AO value. Intensity multiplication and other tweaks, if needed, should be done here on the Shader Graph side.",
